    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a32fafbf821b6c84ca74a356f7b9b009, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Hgh.$.$.
    displayText: Hgh...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 708777bab44cd2f45b2812ba56f77be9, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0400000005000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Ha.$.$. $$haha.$.$. $$hahahaha.$.$. $$HAHAHAHAHA.$.$.
    displayText: Ha... haha... hahahaha... HAHAHAHAHA...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 708777bab44cd2f45b2812ba56f77be9, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 030000000400000006000000060000000b0000000c0000000e0000000e00000017000000180000001a0000001a0000002500000026000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: W-$$what? $$Rika.$.$. $$w-why are you laughing.$.$.?
    displayText: W-what? Rika... w-why are you laughing...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 020000000200000008000000080000000d0000000e00000010000000100000002700000028000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Maya.$.$. $$Mahiru.$.$. $$Are you kidding me? $$Or to be precise, $$am
      I kidding myself? $$What the heck is this.$.$.\r"
    displayText: "Maya... Mahiru... Are you kidding me? Or to be precise, am I kidding
      myself? What the heck is this...\r"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.022
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 050000000600000008000000080000000f000000100000001200000012000000260000002600000038000000380000004d0000004d0000006300000064000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: 'Our human subconscious are quite funny, $$aren''t they? '
    displayText: 'Our human subconscious are quite funny, aren''t they? '
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 780e7268fcdef544198c0b3d5d94d3f9, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.022
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2800000028000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Whenever a traumatic event occurs, $$we always deny it to save our conscious
      self from the truth.
    displayText: Whenever a traumatic event occurs, we always deny it to save our
      conscious self from the truth.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 780e7268fcdef544198c0b3d5d94d3f9, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.022
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2300000023000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The only thing that makes my case different is that I never moved on from
      it.$.$.
    displayText: The only thing that makes my case different is that I never moved
      on from it...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 4d0000004e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b4e91975d53cca641b0139806b4b5627, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: A normal, $$healthy person would break out of denial, $$then get angry,
      $$and finally accept the truth in a few weeks or months.
    displayText: A normal, healthy person would break out of denial, then get angry,
      and finally accept the truth in a few weeks or months.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0a0000000a00000034000000340000004400000044000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: However.$.$. $$I got stuck in the swamp of denial for such a long time
      that I forgot that I was even trapped in it in the first place.$.$.
    displayText: However... I got stuck in the swamp of denial for such a long time
      that I forgot that I was even trapped in it in the first place...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.025
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 08000000090000000b0000000b0000008200000083000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika.$.$.
    displayText: Rika...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ec1ce6e63321a941829a1566caac4f2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0500000006000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya reached her hand out to Rika, $$but Rika shook her hand off, $$in
      the same motion that resulted in Mahiru's death.
    displayText: Maya reached her hand out to Rika, but Rika shook her hand off,
      in the same motion that resulted in Mahiru's death.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 23000000230000004000000040000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: 'Maya''s eyes widened.

'
    displayText: 'Maya''s eyes widened.

'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '!$!$!'
    displayText: '!!!'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 639c4c430b79fb34da6880f1d3c20f4d, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: You're wondering why after knowing the truth, $$I can shake you off like
      that. $$Am I right?
    displayText: You're wondering why after knowing the truth, I can shake you off
      like that. Am I right?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a32fafbf821b6c84ca74a356f7b9b009, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.025
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2e0000002e0000004d0000004d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Of course I am! You are my creation after all. $$And now you're thinking
      of asking me if I'm okay.
    displayText: Of course I am! You are my creation after all. And now you're thinking
      of asking me if I'm okay.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c85d44a3c2a8ea9468cde6b7baca4bfc, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.025
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2f0000002f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: $Well, $$I'm not! Thank you for asking though, $$but how can I be okay
      after all this???
    displayText: Well, I'm not! Thank you for asking though, but how can I be okay
      after all this???
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c85d44a3c2a8ea9468cde6b7baca4bfc, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.022
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0000000006000000060000002c0000002c000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: How can I be okay after knowing I've been selfishly running away from my
      own problem?
    displayText: How can I be okay after knowing I've been selfishly running away
      from my own problem?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
