    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 18000000190000001b0000001b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Turning a blind eye to something you can't handle is just pathetic and
      unforgivable.$.$.
    displayText: Turning a blind eye to something you can't handle is just pathetic
      and unforgivable...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 163aeeba01ab15e40828b78dd5e2482f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.05
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 5400000055000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The problem won't be solved by just waiting. $$It's exactly what those
      parents did to me.
    displayText: The problem won't be solved by just waiting. It's exactly what those
      parents did to me.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 708777bab44cd2f45b2812ba56f77be9, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.045
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2d0000002d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: 'It''s exactly what my friends and teachers did to me. '
    displayText: 'It''s exactly what my friends and teachers did to me. '
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a32fafbf821b6c84ca74a356f7b9b009, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It's exactly what the world has always done to me.$.$.
    displayText: It's exactly what the world has always done to me...
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 163aeeba01ab15e40828b78dd5e2482f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.035
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3200000033000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "I- $$I.$.$. $$I can't rely on Maya, $$on illusion. $$I need to face\u2014
      Ah.$.$."
    displayText: "I- I... I can't rely on Maya, on illusion. I need to face\u2014
